# backslash-comment-crlf: Does a CRLF file behave like an LF file for a comment that ends in a backslash (XPPAUT 8.2.2)?
# xpp: v@3=2
# pc: ODE0076
# ruling: the carriage return is part of the line end; the next line is swallowed as in an LF file (language.md, Lines).
# a note \
x'=1
x'=2
x(0)=0
aux v=x
@ total=1,dt=0.5,meth=euler
